{
  "_comment": [
    "Locked Vietnamese terminology for CONNECT Plus.",
    "Safety-critical wording must not drift between answers. A senior who learns",
    "'xac thuc hai buoc' in one answer and meets 'xac minh 2 yeu to' in the next",
    "has to relearn the concept. Worse, a mistranslated proper noun ('myGov' ->",
    "'chinh phu cua toi') makes the instruction impossible to follow.",
    "Edit this file rather than the prompt templates: it is injected into every",
    "prompt and audited after every answer."
  ],
